{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13003","headline":"答皇甫十六侍御北归留别作 · 独孤及","name":"答皇甫十六侍御北归留别作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"正当楚客伤春地，岂是骚人道别时。\n俱徇空名嗟欲老，况将行役料前期。\n劳生多故应同病，羸马单车莫自悲。\n明日相望隔云水，解顔唯有袖中诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"独孤及","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13003.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13003","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}